{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\"score\": 2, \"why\": \"概括清楚抓住了贯穿全文的核心矛盾：既渴望亲密和被爱，又担心失去自主，并指出他曾向对方的回应索取安全保证，后来转向自主，也认识到感情不能提供永久安稳；结尾仍保留伤害、失去与自主之间的张力。不过，它没有完整呈现最高档要求的转变链条，尤其未明确写出他曾把亲密、安顿与自我价值混在一起，也没有点出他进一步发现“过度自保”同样有局限，以及最终是同时珍惜亲密与独立、主动承担选择代价。因此更符合2分。\"}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ad3f1596-4b7f-4cdb-b556-3c2ea7e9b4fb", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261021T075511186144Z", "elapsed_seconds": 13.14, "completed_utc": "2026-10-21T07:55:24.321301+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "4096e47d4012d8129e95218bd1e1d7c0278d4fcefb42eaecd8ca3cb348bf65a1", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "722a90984d40295e55caba596589f01b85b2b784e2b74dd51fb8de09bf479560", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-202610